  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.38,
      "end_seconds": 4.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.65,
      "end_seconds": 9.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.51,
      "end_seconds": 16.6,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "I've been feeling faint, and I wanted to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.28,
      "end_seconds": 21.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.87,
      "end_seconds": 24.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Probably two weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.37,
      "end_seconds": 28.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.55,
      "end_seconds": 45.64,
      "duration_seconds": 14.09,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get being confused as well. The being confused? That's been for six months. As for being confused, it feels moderate to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.83,
      "end_seconds": 50.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Any fever or chest pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.42,
      "end_seconds": 54.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.7,
      "end_seconds": 59.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.16,
      "end_seconds": 65.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.62,
      "end_seconds": 70.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.18,
      "end_seconds": 73.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.88,
      "end_seconds": 94.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.7,
      "end_seconds": 112.17,
      "duration_seconds": 15.47,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. My husband and I live above the shop. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.77,
      "end_seconds": 117.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.06,
      "end_seconds": 119.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.68,
      "end_seconds": 123.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.72,
      "end_seconds": 128.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.28,
      "end_seconds": 131.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.11,
      "end_seconds": 141.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Right, nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.73,
      "end_seconds": 144.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.57,
      "end_seconds": 147.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.62,
      "end_seconds": 158.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.16,
      "end_seconds": 174.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Alright, sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.99,
      "end_seconds": 197.28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.29,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 17, saturation 99 percent. And pulse 110, pressure 101 over 59, temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.11,
      "end_seconds": 203.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.15,
      "end_seconds": 215.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.34,
      "end_seconds": 217.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.05,
      "end_seconds": 232.05,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "You are yellow, your tummy is swollen with fluid, and your pulse is very fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.95,
      "end_seconds": 233.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.52,
      "end_seconds": 241.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.66,
      "end_seconds": 266.7,
      "duration_seconds": 10.04,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, this is probably a bleed from enlarged veins in the gullet in liver disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.63,
      "end_seconds": 274.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.55,
      "end_seconds": 303.98,
      "duration_seconds": 27.43,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a bleed from enlarged veins in the gullet in liver disease, and we'll know more once the an urgent endoscopy is back. Let's get an urgent endoscopy, for variceal bleed. I'll start you on terlipressin, 2 milligrams, now, single dose. That's for variceal bleeding. You are going straight to resus, I am starting two drips."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.66,
      "end_seconds": 330.0,
      "duration_seconds": 20.34,
      "text": "I'd like you to see the emergency team as well, and I'll write the referral. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. Let's review you straight away. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.4,
      "end_seconds": 335.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}